        {
          "id": "blk_pht3ety0mr",
          "type": "component/sp-words-47",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "t1": "★ about this collection",
            "t2": "We publish slowly,",
            "t3": "and we publish what matters.",
            "t4": "This is not content marketing. It",
            "t5": "'",
            "t6": "s a small, carefully tended library of the writing behind this work — essays on caring for place, talks on the moment we",
            "t7": "'",
            "t8": "re in, working papers on how communities make decisions together, and notes from the Front Range itself.",
            "t9": "Many of these pieces live on the writers",
            "t10": "'",
            "t11": "own sites — we link out and trust you to follow. Some live here, where we can edit, footnote, and add to them over time.",
            "t12": "All of them are offered as context — so the work we do on the ground reads in its larger frame.",
            "t13": "— 04.1 —"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sec_5eensq48mc",
